<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH REPUBLIC AND INDIA LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH REPUBLIC AND INDIA LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PRIBRAM, Czech Republic 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic</p>
<p>and India were level 1-1 after Friday's opening singles matches</p>
<p>in their Davis Cup world group first round tie.</p>
<p>Results (Czech names first):</p>
<p>Petr Korda beat Mahesh Bhupathi 6-3 6-7 (2-7) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Jiri Novak lost to Leander Paes 2-6 3-6 7-6 (7-5) 3-6</p>
</text>
